46: ### 3.1. TV-Safe Margin Geometry (1920x1080)
47: The television screen operates at 1920x1080 resolution with a mandatory 5% overscan boundary:
48: - Horizontal safe margin: $96\text{px}$ on both left and right.
49: - Valid interactive horizontal bounds: $[96\text{px}, 1824\text{px}]$.
50: - Usable width: $1824 - 96 = 1728\text{px}$.
51: 
52: #### Search Bar Bounds
53: - Width: `max-width: 1100px`, centered with `margin: 0 auto`.
54: - Left coordinate: $(1920 - 1100) / 2 = 410\text{px}$.
55: - Right coordinate: $410 + 1100 = 1510\text{px}$.
56: - Verification: $410\text{px} \ge 96\text{px}$ and $1510\text{px} \le 1824\text{px}$ (Satisfies `tests/adversarial-m2-layout.js` line 486).
57: 
58: #### Virtual Keyboard Bounds
59: - Row 1 (Numbers 1–0): 10 keys $\times$ 72px $+$ 9 gaps $\times$ 12px $= 720 + 108 = 828\text{px}$.
60: - Row 2 (Letters Q–P): 10 keys $\times$ 72px $+$ 9 gaps $\times$ 12px $= 828\text{px}$.
61: - Row 3 (Letters A–L): 9 keys $\times$ 72px $+$ 8 gaps $\times$ 12px $= 648 + 96 = 744\text{px}$.
62: - Row 4 (Letters Z–M): 7 keys $\times$ 72px $+$ 6 gaps $\times$ 12px $= 504 + 72 = 576\text{px}$.
63: - Row 5 (Actions Space, Backspace, Clear): 3 keys $\times$ 132px $+$ 2 gaps $\times$ 12px $= 396 + 24 = 420\text{px}$.
64: - Keyboard container width: `max-width: 880px`, centered with `margin: 0 auto`.
65: - Left coordinate for 828px row: $(1920 - 828) / 2 = 546\text{px}$.
66: - Right coordinate: $546 + 828 = 1374\text{px}$.
67: - Verification: $546\text{px} \ge 96\text{px}$ and $1374\text{px} \le 1824\text{px}$ (Satisfies `tests/adversarial-m2-layout.js` line 488).
